    {
      "name": "session-discipline",
      "description": "Start every session from the written roadmap and the git state, keep the facts a compaction loses, and close in a fixed order: retrospective, roadmap and log, handoff, commit. Plus an instruction-file audit, a guided project setup for new users, and a router over every skill.",
