    {
      "name": "planning",
      "description": "Turn an idea into decided, sliced work: a brainstorm that widens the options first, a task restated before it starts, a relentless design interview, PRD synthesis, vertical-slice issues, architecture deepening, design sketches compared before any code is written, and an audit of the mistakes agents repeat in a project, with a fix for each at the highest layer. Adapted from mattpocock/skills, and architect, sharpen and agent-friendly-audit from pstack.",
